---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import pages from '../data/pages.json';
---
<Layout title="Interior Page Review | CIDWP" noindex>
  <main class="shell migration-review" id="main">
    <a href="/design-review/">← Homepage Design Review</a>
    <h1>Interior Page Review</h1>
    <p>Source content captured October 6, 2026. Compare each rebuilt page with its original. The approved homepage design is retained. Forms use the existing appointment destination until Bryan provides Jotform.</p>
    <details class="source-notes">
      <summary>Source Content And Launch Notes</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>The current contact page lists Monday–Friday; the homepage and standalone Smile Club page list Monday–Thursday.</li>
        <li>The doctor page names Hunter McAreavy. Older campaign pages still feature Audrey Greaves; sedation names Shaley Baker. Original references and quotations are preserved.</li>
        <li>The source navigation links to Eve financing, while its Payment Plans page uses Cherry. Both remain available.</li>
        <li>The standalone Smile Club page retains its original testimonial copy and placeholder portraits.</li>
        <li>Jotform is pending on Contact, Request An Appointment, the two PPC pages, and the standalone Smile Club page.</li>
        <li>The neighborhood office-tour videos still use the original WordPress media URL. Preserve or migrate that file before retiring WordPress.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <table><thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>Preview</th><th>Original</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {pages.map(page => <tr><td>{page.title}</td><td><a href={page.path}>Open Preview</a></td><td><a href={page.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Original</a></td><td>{page.hasForms ? 'Jotform Pending' : 'Ready For Review'}</td></tr>)}
    </tbody></table>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .migration-review { padding-block: 50px 100px; }
  h1 { margin-block: 30px; font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); }
  p { max-width: 900px; }
  a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
  td, th { text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccdedf; padding: 16px 12px; }
  th { background: #e3fbff; }
  .source-notes { margin-block: 24px 36px; padding: 20px; background: #f0fafb; border: 1px solid #ccdedf; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 24px; margin-top: 18px; }
  li { margin-block: 10px; }
  @media(max-width:600px) { td,th { padding:12px 5px; font-size:12px; } }
</style>
